OL,3,GNEWSABrother of Kriss Donald killers
OL,4,Aadmits role in #600,000 pensioner
OL,5,Afrauds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe brother of two of Kriss Donald's
OL,8,Fkillers is facing a lengthy jail-term
OL,9,Ffor his role in a #600,000 fraud plot.
OL,11,FThe High Court in Glasgow heard how
OL,12,FAhsan Shahid - brother of Imran and
OL,13,FZeeshan Shahid - was part of a gang who
OL,14,Fduped almost 60 pensioners by posing as
OL,15,Fpolice officers or bank investigators
OL,16,Fto con victims.
OL,18,FThe 41-year-old, along with Sean Singh,
OL,19,F21, and Duncan Currie, 42, managed to
OL,20,Fobtain cash, Rolex watches, designer
OL,21,Fclothes, Apple products and an e-bike.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
